---
title: "isolated_asset_borrow_constraint - Isolated Asset Borrowing Rules (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_asset_type: classify asset (main, emerging, isolated)
    q_check_asset_type --> q_main: asset is main type
    q_main --> q_check_existing_isolated: check obligation has no isolated debt
    q_check_existing_isolated --> q_error_has_isolated: obligation has isolated debt
    q_error_has_isolated --> [*]: abort error (cannot mix isolated and other debt)
    q_check_existing_isolated --> q_allow_main: no isolated debt
    q_allow_main --> [*]: allow borrow (0.3% fee)
    q_check_asset_type --> q_emerging: asset is emerging type
    q_emerging --> q_check_existing_isolated2: check obligation has no isolated debt
    q_check_existing_isolated2 --> q_error_has_isolated2: obligation has isolated debt
    q_error_has_isolated2 --> [*]: abort error (cannot mix)
    q_check_existing_isolated2 --> q_allow_emerging: no isolated debt
    q_allow_emerging --> [*]: allow borrow (1% fee)
    q_check_asset_type --> q_isolated: asset is isolated type
    q_isolated --> q_check_existing_debt: check obligation has any existing debt
    q_check_existing_debt --> q_error_has_debt: obligation has non-isolated debt
    q_error_has_debt --> [*]: abort error (cannot add isolated to existing debt)
    q_check_existing_debt --> q_check_same_isolated: no existing non-isolated debt
    q_check_same_isolated --> q_error_diff_isolated: has different isolated type debt
    q_error_diff_isolated --> [*]: abort error (only one isolated type per obligation)
    q_check_same_isolated --> q_check_collateral_ratio: same isolated type or no debt
    q_check_collateral_ratio --> q_error_ratio: collateral ratio < 200%
    q_error_ratio --> [*]: abort error (insufficient collateral for isolated)
    q_check_collateral_ratio --> q_allow_isolated: collateral ratio >= 200%
    q_allow_isolated --> [*]: allow borrow (1% fee)

    note right of q_isolated
        INV-001: isolated asset debt cannot coexist with any other debt type
        INV-002: only one isolated asset type per obligation
        INV-003: isolated asset requires 200% collateral ratio
        INV-004: isolated asset borrow fee = 1%
    end note

    note right of q_main
        INV-005: main asset borrow fee = 0.3%
        INV-006: emerging asset borrow fee = 1%
        INV-007: main/emerging assets can coexist in same obligation
    end note
